      "text": "come and lay thy hand upon her, Matt. 9:18 (Mark 5:23). children, that he should put his hands on them, Matt. 19:13. he laid his hands upon a few sick folk, Mark 6:5 (Luke 4:40; Morm. 9:24; D&C 66:9). beseech him to put his hand upon him, Mark 7:32. spit on his eyes, and put his hands upon him, Mark 8:23. they shall lay hands on the sick, Mark 16:18 (Morm. 9:24). he laid his hands on her … she was made straight, Luke 13:13. apostles … laid their hands on them, Acts 6:6 (8:17). putting his hands on him said, Brother Saul, Acts 9:17. had fasted and prayed, and laid their hands, Acts 13:3. prayed, and laid his hands on him, and healed him, Acts 28:8. gift … given … with the laying on of the hands, 1 Tim. 4:14. Lay hands suddenly on no man, 1 Tim. 5:22. gift of God, which is in thee by the putting on of my hands, 2 Tim. 1:6. doctrine of baptisms, and of laying on of hands, Heb. 6:2.",
